+# Changelog
+All notable changes to weewx-sqm will be documented in this file.
+
+The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
+and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
+
+## [0.1.1] - 2026-02-08
+
+### Added
+- `sqmTime` epoch timestamps for SQM samples, archive records, and Conditions JSON output.
+- `max_sample_age` to suppress stale SQM values in current JSON while still reporting last `sqmTime`.
+- Archive schema and Conditions `daily_captures` updates to include `sqmTime`.
+
+## [0.1.0] - 2026-02-08
+
+### Added
+- SQM-LE TCP polling service with loop packet injection and median archive aggregation.
+- Derived metrics: `cdm2`, `nsu`, `nelm`.
+- Skyfield-based `solarAlt`, `lunarAlt`, and `lunarPhase` calculations.
+- Daylight/twilight filtering via `solar_alt_max` (skip polling when sun is above threshold).
+- Installer-driven DB schema updates for SQM fields (SQLite/MySQL).
+- Interactive installer prompts for host/port and validation tests (SQM + Skyfield).
+- Conditions skin patching (current + dataset daily_captures) to add SQM fields.
+- Skyfield cache directory support via `skyfield_cache`.
+
+### Changed
+- Extension packaging via `build_package.py` (weectl installable tarball).
+- README expanded with configuration guidance, install steps, and troubleshooting notes.
+
+### Fixed
+- Service load path and installer merging behavior for `data_services`.
+- Installer Skyfield test and runtime cache permissions.
